{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, מְטָא","hw":"מְטָא","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">מְטָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְטָה</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. reach, attain (</strong>𝔗 id., Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܡܛܳܐ</span>, cf. Chr-Pal. Schulth<sup>Lex. 108</sup>; Ethiopic መጠወ Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">أَنْطَى</span> (for <span dir=\"rtl\">أَمْطَى</span>) Nö<sup>ZMG xi (1886), 736</sup>; distinct from BH <span dir=\"rtl\">מָצָא</span>, etc., q.v.<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְטָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:25\" href=\"/Daniel.4.25\">Dn 4:25</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ה—ָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:13\" href=\"/Daniel.7.13\">7:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:22\" href=\"/Daniel.7.22\">22</a>; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְטַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:19\" href=\"/Daniel.4.19\">4:19</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְטָת</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:21\" href=\"/Daniel.4.21\">21</a> Qr (Kt, erron., <span dir=\"rtl\">מטית</span> K<sup>§ 47, Beisp. 1) α)</sup>); 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְטוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:25\" href=\"/Daniel.6.25\">6:25</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִמִטֵא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:8\" href=\"/Daniel.4.8\">4:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:17\" href=\"/Daniel.4.17\">17</a>;— <strong>1.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>reach, come to</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:25\" href=\"/Daniel.6.25\">Dn 6:25</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ל</span> loc.); <em>come</em> unto, as far as <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:13\" href=\"/Daniel.7.13\">7:13</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">עַד</span> pers.); abs. <em>arrive</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:22\" href=\"/Daniel.7.22\">7:22</a> (of time; 𝔊 ἐδόθη; v. Nes<sup>MM 41</sup> who cp. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">عَطَى</span> iv. <em>give</em>). <strong>b.</strong>  <em>reach, extend</em>, ל loc. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:8\" href=\"/Daniel.4.8\">4:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:17\" href=\"/Daniel.4.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:19\" href=\"/Daniel.4.19\">19</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  c. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> pers. <em>come upon, befall</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:21\" href=\"/Daniel.4.21\">4:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:25\" href=\"/Daniel.4.25\">25</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, מִישָׁאֵל","prev":"BDB Aramaic, מַחְלְקָה²"}